{"id":"raiz","lemma":"raiz","pos":"noun","rank":3361,"glosses":["root (part of a plant)","root (part of a tooth)","root (part of a hair)"],"ipa":"/ʁaˈis/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"raízes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f0/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-raiz.wav","examples":[{"text":"A raiz quadrada de nove é três.","en":"The square root of nine is three.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"square","l":"quadrado"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"nine"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"three"}]},{"text":"O amor ao dinheiro é a raiz de todo o mal.","en":"Love of money is the root of all evil.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"love"},null,{"g":"money"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / to"},null,null,null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"badly"}],"phrases":[[7,9,"entirely, completely"]]},{"text":"Qual é a raiz quadrada de 100?","en":"What's the square root of 100?","words":[null,null,{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"square","l":"quadrado"},{"g":"of / from"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"no way"]]},{"text":"O dinheiro é a raiz de todos os males.","en":"Money is the root of all evil.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"money"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"everyone"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"badly","l":"mal"}]},{"text":"A pobreza é a raiz de todo o mal.","en":"Poverty is the root of all evil.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"poverty"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / to"},null,null,null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"badly"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"entirely, completely"]]}]}